    26-. "<div>1. Resolve the pinned adapter<br />binding and negotiate the<br />descriptor capability</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->42
    42-. "<div>2. Load the binding from the<br />leased, verified installed<br />version</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->48
    42-. "<div>3. Request the active machine<br />of the authorized attach<br />session</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->45
    45-. "<div>4. Read the configured CPU,<br />machine mapping and supported<br />observations through the<br />backend interface</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[gRPC]</div>" .->52
    52-. "<div>5. Return available live<br />session data and negotiated<br />capabilities</div><div style='font-size: 70%'>[gRPC]</div>" .->45
    45-. "<div>6. Normalize available data<br />into the versioned descriptor<br />and scoped map revision</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->42
    42-. "<div>7. Return the negotiated<br />descriptor or a stable<br />unavailable result</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->26
    26-. "<div>8. Bind only the selected<br />instance and apply its<br />current map revision</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->33
    33-. "<div>9. Resolve the exact CPU<br />variant and declared platform<br />profile</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->34
    34-. "<div>10. Read declared profile<br />data from the verified<br />package if required</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->48
    33-. "<div>11. Read the user's saved<br />display byte-order preference</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->46
    33-. "<div>12. Publish scoped debugger<br />rows or an available raw view</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->24
    11-. "<div>13. Observe the target<br />context, address limits and<br />available operations</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->24
    32-. "<div>14. Render target-specific<br />registers, disassembly,<br />memory and timing</div><div style='font-size: 70%'></div>" .->11

